Mapping **Java inheritance** to **database tables**.

1️⃣ **SINGLE_TABLE (Most Used)**

```java
@Entity
@Inheritance(strategy = InheritanceType.SINGLE_TABLE)
@DiscriminatorColumn(name = "type")
class Vehicle { }

@Entity
