static List<Integer> findPerfectNumbers(int n) {
    List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();

    for (int i = 2; i <= n; i++) {
        int sum = 1; // 1 is always a divisor

        for (int j = 2; j <= i / 2; j++) {
            if (i % j == 0) sum += j; // Add divisor
        }

        if (sum == i) result.add(i); // Perfect number check
    }
    return result;
}
```

**Time Complexity:** `O(n²)`
**Output (1000):** `[6, 28, 496]`

